version 0.15
component tps5430ddar

kind         part
mpn          TPS5430DDAR
manufacturer Texas Instruments
category     regulator
datasheet    https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps5430.pdf

symbol regulators:dc-dc-soic8
footprint soic:soic-8-ep
# The part's own ratings (ADR-0026): what the device is, not what the design asks of it.
# The 28V is the supply voltage limit the datasheet revision this file was written against gives
# for VIN to GND; TI's current product page lists Vin max 36V, so the figure is due for a re-check
# against the datasheet (docs/backlog.md F42). The terminal pair names the two pins it is about,
# so the checker can compare it with the window the design declares.
ratings
  voltage        voltage  28V    7 6
  rated_current  current  3A

pins
  1  BOOT    passive
  2  NC1     no_connect
  3  NC2     no_connect
  4  VSENSE  input
  5  ENA     input
  6  GND     power
  7  VIN     power_in
  8  PH      passive
  9  PAD     power
